---
import BaseLayout from "@layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Run Your Firm. Stop Letting It Run You. | Attorney Assistant"
  description="We build the teams and systems that keep your firm moving — so you can step out of the constant noise. See how it works."
  noindex={true}
>

  <!-- ─── HERO ─── -->
  <section class="relative overflow-hidden bg-gray-900">
    <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-br from-brand-navy via-gray-900 to-brand-800"></div>
    <div class="absolute inset-0 opacity-5">
      <div class="absolute inset-0" style="background-image: radial-gradient(circle at 1px 1px, white 1px, transparent 0); background-size: 40px 40px;"></div>
    </div>
    <div class="grain-overlay"></div>

    <div class="container-wide relative z-10 py-20 lg:py-28">
      <div class="grid lg:grid-cols-2 gap-12 lg:gap-16 items-start">
        <div class="reveal">
          <span class="badge bg-white/10 text-white/80 border-white/10 mb-4">The Evolution of Staffing</span>
          <h1 class="text-display-lg md:text-display-xl font-heading text-white leading-tight mb-6">
            Run Your Firm.<br />
            <span class="text-gradient-gold">Stop Letting It Run You.</span>
          </h1>
          <p class="text-lg md:text-xl text-gray-300 mb-4 leading-relaxed">
            We build the teams and systems that keep your firm moving &mdash; so you can step out of the constant noise.
          </p>
          <p class="text-base text-gray-400 italic mb-8">
            We own the outcome, not just the task. So your nights stop getting hijacked by chaos and "just one more thing."
          </p>

          <!-- Value props -->
          <div class="space-y-4 mb-8 reveal" style="transition-delay: 200ms;">
            <div class="flex items-start gap-4 p-4 rounded-xl border border-white/10 bg-white/5">
              <div class="flex-shrink-0 w-10 h-10 rounded-lg bg-brand-gold/15 flex items-center justify-center mt-0.5">
                <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-brand-gold" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M18 18.72a9.094 9.094 0 003.741-.479 3 3 0 00-4.682-2.72m.94 3.198l.001.031c0 .225-.012.447-.037.666A11.944 11.944 0 0112 21c-2.17 0-4.207-.576-5.963-1.584A6.062 6.062 0 016 18.719m12 0a5.971 5.971 0 00-.941-3.197m0 0A5.995 5.995 0 0012 12.75a5.995 5.995 0 00-5.058 2.772m0 0a3 3 0 00-4.681 2.72 8.986 8.986 0 003.74.477m.94-3.197a5.971 5.971 0 00-.94 3.197M15 6.75a3 3 0 11-6 0 3 3 0 016 0zm6 3a2.25 2.25 0 11-4.5 0 2.25 2.25 0 014.5 0zm-13.5 0a2.25 2.25 0 11-4.5 0 2.25 2.25 0 014.5 0z" /></svg>
              </div>
              <div>
                <p class="text-sm font-heading text-white">A Real Team, Not Random Help</p>
                <p class="text-xs text-gray-400 mt-0.5">People who integrate into your firm, learn your processes, and take ownership of outcomes.</p>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="flex items-start gap-4 p-4 rounded-xl border border-white/10 bg-white/5">
              <div class="flex-shrink-0 w-10 h-10 rounded-lg bg-brand-gold/15 flex items-center justify-center mt-0.5">
                <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-brand-gold" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M9 12.75L11.25 15 15 9.75m-3-7.036A11.959 11.959 0 013.598 6 11.99 11.99 0 003 9.749c0 5.592 3.824 10.29 9 11.623 5.176-1.332 9-6.03 9-11.622 0-1.31-.21-2.571-.598-3.751h-.152c-3.196 0-6.1-1.248-8.25-3.285z" /></svg>
              </div>
              <div>
                <p class="text-sm font-heading text-white">Systems That Keep Things Moving</p>
                <p class="text-xs text-gray-400 mt-0.5">Nothing stalls, slips, or piles up. Work gets done the right way, every time &mdash; without you checking.</p>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="flex items-start gap-4 p-4 rounded-xl border border-white/10 bg-white/5">
              <div class="flex-shrink-0 w-10 h-10 rounded-lg bg-brand-gold/15 flex items-center justify-center mt-0.5">
                <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-brand-gold" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M21.752 15.002A9.718 9.718 0 0118 15.75c-5.385 0-9.75-4.365-9.75-9.75 0-1.33.266-2.597.748-3.752A9.753 9.753 0 003 11.25C3 16.635 7.365 21 12.75 21a9.753 9.753 0 009.002-5.998z" /></svg>
              </div>
              <div>
                <p class="text-sm font-heading text-white">Coverage When You're Off</p>
                <p class="text-xs text-gray-400 mt-0.5">Nights, weekends, overflow &mdash; handled without you stepping in. Your evenings are yours again.</p>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-x-6 gap-y-2 text-sm text-gray-400 reveal" style="transition-delay: 350ms;">
            <span class="flex items-center gap-2">
              <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-brand-gold" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20"><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M16.704 4.153a.75.75 0 01.143 1.052l-8 10.5a.75.75 0 01-1.127.075l-4.5-4.5a.75.75 0 011.06-1.06l3.894 3.893 7.48-9.817a.75.75 0 011.05-.143z" clip-rule="evenodd" /></svg>
              Free &mdash; no commitment
            </span>
            <span class="flex items-center gap-2">
              <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-brand-gold" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20"><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M16.704 4.153a.75.75 0 01.143 1.052l-8 10.5a.75.75 0 01-1.127.075l-4.5-4.5a.75.75 0 011.06-1.06l3.894 3.893 7.48-9.817a.75.75 0 011.05-.143z" clip-rule="evenodd" /></svg>
              30-minute call
            </span>
            <span class="flex items-center gap-2">
              <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-brand-gold" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20"><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M16.704 4.153a.75.75 0 01.143 1.052l-8 10.5a.75.75 0 01-1.127.075l-4.5-4.5a.75.75 0 011.06-1.06l3.894 3.893 7.48-9.817a.75.75 0 011.05-.143z" clip-rule="evenodd" /></svg>
              Actionable next steps
            </span>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Booking Widget -->
        <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl p-6 md:p-8 shadow-2xl reveal" style="transition-delay: 150ms" id="book">
          <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-4">
            <div class="featured-icon featured-icon-md featured-icon-gold">
              <svg class="w-5 h-5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M6.75 3v2.25M17.25 3v2.25M3 18.75V7.5a2.25 2.25 0 012.25-2.25h13.5A2.25 2.25 0 0121 7.5v11.25m-18 0A2.25 2.25 0 005.25 21h13.5A2.25 2.25 0 0021 18.75m-18 0v-7.5A2.25 2.25 0 015.25 9h13.5A2.25 2.25 0 0121 11.25v7.5" /></svg>
            </div>
            <div>
              <h2 class="text-xl font-heading text-gray-900">See How It Works</h2>
              <p class="text-sm text-gray-500">Free &mdash; 30 minutes</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="meetings-iframe-container" data-src="https://meet.attorneyassistant.com/meetings/attorney-assistant/evolution-of-staffing?embed=true"></div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ─── Evolution Image ─── -->
  <section class="section-padding bg-gray-50">
    <div class="container-wide">
      <div class="rounded-2xl overflow-hidden shadow-lg reveal">
        <img src="/images/evolution-of-staffing.jpg" alt="The Evolution of Staffing — from cave to modern office to walking free" class="w-full h-auto" loading="lazy" />
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ─── Section 1: The Real Pain ─── -->
  <section class="section-padding bg-white">
    <div class="container-narrow">
      <div class="max-w-3xl">
        <span class="badge bg-brand-gold/10 text-brand-gold border-brand-gold/20 mb-4 reveal">The Real Pain</span>
        <h2 class="text-display-sm md:text-display-md font-heading text-gray-900 mb-6 reveal" style="transition-delay: 0.1s;">
          This Isn't About Growth. It's About Pressure.
        </h2>
        <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-10 items-start reveal" style="transition-delay: 0.15s;">
          <div>
            <p class="text-gray-600 mb-4">You're not short on work.</p>
            <p class="text-gray-600 mb-4">You're short on:</p>
            <ul class="space-y-3 mb-6">
              <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
                <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-brand-gold mt-0.5 flex-shrink-0" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20"><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M16.704 4.153a.75.75 0 01.143 1.052l-8 10.5a.75.75 0 01-1.127.075l-4.5-4.5a.75.75 0 011.06-1.06l3.894 3.893 7.48-9.817a.75.75 0 011.05-.143z" clip-rule="evenodd" /></svg>
                <span class="text-gray-700 font-medium">Time to think</span>
              </li>
              <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
                <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-brand-gold mt-0.5 flex-shrink-0" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20"><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M16.704 4.153a.75.75 0 01.143 1.052l-8 10.5a.75.75 0 01-1.127.075l-4.5-4.5a.75.75 0 011.06-1.06l3.894 3.893 7.48-9.817a.75.75 0 011.05-.143z" clip-rule="evenodd" /></svg>
                <span class="text-gray-700 font-medium">Space to breathe</span>
              </li>
              <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
                <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-brand-gold mt-0.5 flex-shrink-0" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20"><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M16.704 4.153a.75.75 0 01.143 1.052l-8 10.5a.75.75 0 01-1.127.075l-4.5-4.5a.75.75 0 011.06-1.06l3.894 3.893 7.48-9.817a.75.75 0 011.05-.143z" clip-rule="evenodd" /></svg>
                <span class="text-gray-700 font-medium">Confidence things are handled without you checking</span>
              </li>
            </ul>
          </div>
          <div class="bg-brand-navy/5 border border-brand-navy/10 rounded-xl p-6">
            <p class="text-gray-600 leading-relaxed">The problem isn't the volume. <strong class="text-gray-900">It's that everything depends on you.</strong></p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ─── Section 2: The Shift ─── -->
  <section class="relative overflow-hidden bg-gradient-to-b from-brand-navy via-brand-800 to-brand-navy grain-overlay section-padding">
    <div class="absolute inset-0">
      <div class="absolute top-20 left-1/4 w-96 h-96 bg-brand-gold/10 rounded-full blur-3xl"></div>
    </div>
    <div class="container-narrow relative">
      <span class="badge bg-white/10 text-white/80 border-white/10 mb-4 reveal">The Shift</span>
      <h2 class="text-display-sm md:text-display-md font-heading text-white mb-10 reveal" style="transition-delay: 0.1s;">
        What Changes When the Right System Is in Place
      </h2>
      <div class="grid sm:grid-cols-2 gap-4 reveal" style="transition-delay: 0.15s;">
        <div class="flex items-start gap-4 p-5 rounded-xl border border-white/10 bg-white/5">
          <div class="flex-shrink-0 w-10 h-10 rounded-lg bg-brand-gold/15 flex items-center justify-center mt-0.5">
            <span class="text-brand-gold font-heading font-bold">01</span>
          </div>
          <p class="text-gray-300">Your phone stops dictating your day</p>
        </div>
        <div class="flex items-start gap-4 p-5 rounded-xl border border-white/10 bg-white/5">
          <div class="flex-shrink-0 w-10 h-10 rounded-lg bg-brand-gold/15 flex items-center justify-center mt-0.5">
            <span class="text-brand-gold font-heading font-bold">02</span>
          </div>
          <p class="text-gray-300">Work moves forward without constant oversight</p>
        </div>
        <div class="flex items-start gap-4 p-5 rounded-xl border border-white/10 bg-white/5">
          <div class="flex-shrink-0 w-10 h-10 rounded-lg bg-brand-gold/15 flex items-center justify-center mt-0.5">
            <span class="text-brand-gold font-heading font-bold">03</span>
          </div>
          <p class="text-gray-300">Your team operates with structure instead of guesswork</p>
        </div>
        <div class="flex items-start gap-4 p-5 rounded-xl border border-white/10 bg-white/5">
          <div class="flex-shrink-0 w-10 h-10 rounded-lg bg-brand-gold/15 flex items-center justify-center mt-0.5">
            <span class="text-brand-gold font-heading font-bold">04</span>
          </div>
          <p class="text-gray-300">You finally have time to focus on actual leadership</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <p class="text-center text-white/50 italic mt-8 reveal" style="transition-delay: 0.2s;">This is what a firm should feel like.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ─── Section 3: What You Get ─── -->
  <section class="section-padding bg-white">
    <div class="container-narrow">
      <span class="badge bg-brand-gold/10 text-brand-gold border-brand-gold/20 mb-4 reveal">What You Actually Get</span>
      <h2 class="text-display-sm md:text-display-md font-heading text-gray-900 mb-4 reveal" style="transition-delay: 0.1s;">
        Support That Feels Like Control
      </h2>
      <p class="text-gray-500 mb-10 reveal" style="transition-delay: 0.15s;">Attorney Assistant gives you:</p>
      <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-5 reveal" style="transition-delay: 0.2s;">
        <div class="p-6 rounded-xl bg-gray-50 border border-gray-100">
          <h3 class="font-heading text-gray-900 mb-2">A real team, not random help</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-gray-500">People who integrate into your firm and take ownership.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="p-6 rounded-xl bg-gray-50 border border-gray-100">
          <h3 class="font-heading text-gray-900 mb-2">Systems that keep things moving</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-gray-500">So nothing stalls, slips, or piles up.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="p-6 rounded-xl bg-gray-50 border border-gray-100">
          <h3 class="font-heading text-gray-900 mb-2">Consistency without micromanaging</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-gray-500">Work gets done the right way, every time.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="p-6 rounded-xl bg-gray-50 border border-gray-100">
          <h3 class="font-heading text-gray-900 mb-2">Coverage when you're off</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-gray-500">Nights, weekends, overflow &mdash; handled without you stepping in.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <p class="text-center text-gray-400 italic mt-8 reveal" style="transition-delay: 0.25s;">We don't just lighten the load. We make the load manageable.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ─── Section 4: Lifestyle Payoff ─── -->
  <section class="section-padding bg-gray-50">
    <div class="container-narrow">
      <div class="text-center">
        <span class="badge bg-brand-gold/10 text-brand-gold border-brand-gold/20 mb-4 reveal">The Payoff</span>
        <h2 class="text-display-sm md:text-display-md font-heading text-gray-900 mb-10 reveal" style="transition-delay: 0.1s;">
          What You Get Back
        </h2>
      </div>
      <div class="grid sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-5 reveal" style="transition-delay: 0.15s;">
        <div class="text-center p-5">
          <div class="w-14 h-14 rounded-full bg-brand-gold/15 flex items-center justify-center mx-auto mb-3">
            <svg class="w-6 h-6 text-brand-gold" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M21.752 15.002A9.718 9.718 0 0118 15.75c-5.385 0-9.75-4.365-9.75-9.75 0-1.33.266-2.597.748-3.752A9.753 9.753 0 003 11.25C3 16.635 7.365 21 12.75 21a9.753 9.753 0 009.002-5.998z" /></svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="font-heading text-gray-900 text-sm mb-1">Evenings</h3>
          <p class="text-xs text-gray-500">That aren't constantly interrupted</p>
        </div>
        <div class="text-center p-5">
          <div class="w-14 h-14 rounded-full bg-brand-gold/15 flex items-center justify-center mx-auto mb-3">
            <svg class="w-6 h-6 text-brand-gold" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M15.362 5.214A8.252 8.252 0 0112 21 8.25 8.25 0 016.038 7.048 8.287 8.287 0 009 9.6a8.983 8.983 0 013.361-6.867 8.21 8.21 0 003 2.48z" /><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M12 18a3.75 3.75 0 00.495-7.467 5.99 5.99 0 00-1.925 3.546 5.974 5.974 0 01-2.133-1A3.75 3.75 0 0012 18z" /></svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="font-heading text-gray-900 text-sm mb-1">Fewer Fires</h3>
          <p class="text-xs text-gray-500">To put out every single day</p>
        </div>
        <div class="text-center p-5">
          <div class="w-14 h-14 rounded-full bg-brand-gold/15 flex items-center justify-center mx-auto mb-3">
            <svg class="w-6 h-6 text-brand-gold" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M13.5 6H5.25A2.25 2.25 0 003 8.25v10.5A2.25 2.25 0 005.25 21h10.5A2.25 2.25 0 0018 18.75V10.5m-10.5 6L21 3m0 0h-5.25M21 3v5.25" /></svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="font-heading text-gray-900 text-sm mb-1">Freedom</h3>
          <p class="text-xs text-gray-500">A business that doesn't need your constant attention</p>
        </div>
        <div class="text-center p-5">
          <div class="w-14 h-14 rounded-full bg-brand-gold/15 flex items-center justify-center mx-auto mb-3">
            <svg class="w-6 h-6 text-brand-gold" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M15 19.128a9.38 9.38 0 002.625.372 9.337 9.337 0 004.121-.952 4.125 4.125 0 00-7.533-2.493M15 19.128v-.003c0-1.113-.285-2.16-.786-3.07M15 19.128v.106A12.318 12.318 0 018.624 21c-2.331 0-4.512-.645-6.374-1.766l-.001-.109a6.375 6.375 0 0111.964-3.07M12 6.375a3.375 3.375 0 11-6.75 0 3.375 3.375 0 016.75 0zm8.25 2.25a2.625 2.625 0 11-5.25 0 2.625 2.625 0 015.25 0z" /></svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="font-heading text-gray-900 text-sm mb-1">Family Time</h3>
          <p class="text-xs text-gray-500">That actually feels like time off</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <p class="text-center text-gray-400 italic mt-6 text-sm reveal" style="transition-delay: 0.2s;">This is the part nobody talks about. But it's the part that matters.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ─── Section 5: Differentiator ─── -->
  <section class="relative overflow-hidden bg-gradient-to-b from-brand-navy via-brand-800 to-brand-navy grain-overlay section-padding">
    <div class="container-narrow relative">
      <span class="badge bg-white/10 text-white/80 border-white/10 mb-4 reveal">The Difference</span>
      <h2 class="text-display-sm md:text-display-md font-heading text-white mb-4 reveal" style="transition-delay: 0.1s;">
        We Don't Just Help. We Take Ownership.
      </h2>
      <p class="text-gray-400 mb-8 reveal" style="transition-delay: 0.15s;">You're not hiring another vendor. You're getting a system that:</p>
      <div class="grid md:grid-cols-3 gap-5 reveal" style="transition-delay: 0.2s;">
        <div class="p-5 rounded-xl border border-white/10 bg-white/5">
          <h3 class="font-heading text-white mb-2">Runs With You</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-gray-400">Embedded in your workflow, not bolted on from the outside.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="p-5 rounded-xl border border-white/10 bg-white/5">
          <h3 class="font-heading text-white mb-2">Adapts to Your Firm</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-gray-400">Custom to your bottlenecks, not a one-size-fits-all package.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="p-5 rounded-xl border border-white/10 bg-white/5">
          <h3 class="font-heading text-white mb-2">Improves Everything</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-gray-400">How operations run, not just who's answering the phone.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <p class="text-center text-white/40 italic mt-8 reveal" style="transition-delay: 0.25s;">We own the outcome so you don't have to carry everything yourself.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ─── Section 6: Bottom CTA ─── -->
  <section class="section-padding bg-white">
    <div class="container-narrow">
      <div class="max-w-2xl mx-auto text-center">
        <h2 class="text-display-sm md:text-display-md font-heading text-gray-900 mb-4 reveal">
          See What This Looks Like Inside Your Firm
        </h2>
        <div class="divider-gold-center mb-6"></div>
        <p class="text-lg text-gray-500 mb-8 reveal" style="transition-delay: 0.1s;">
          We'll walk you through exactly how this would work for you &mdash; where it would take pressure off, and what changes immediately.
        </p>
        <a href="#book" class="btn-primary btn-lg group inline-flex reveal" style="transition-delay: 0.15s;">
          See How It Works
          <svg class="w-5 h-5 transition-transform duration-200 group-hover:translate-x-0.5" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="currentColor">
            <path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M3 10a.75.75 0 01.75-.75h10.638L10.23 5.29a.75.75 0 111.04-1.08l5.5 5.25a.75.75 0 010 1.08l-5.5 5.25a.75.75 0 11-1.04-1.08l4.158-3.96H3.75A.75.75 0 013 10z" clip-rule="evenodd" />
          </svg>
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- HubSpot Meetings Embed Script -->
  <script type="text/javascript" src="https://static.hsappstatic.net/MeetingsEmbed/ex/MeetingsEmbedCode.js"></script>

  <style>
    .meetings-iframe-container iframe {
      background: #ffffff !important;
    }
  </style>

  <!-- Tracking -->
  <script is:inline>
    if (typeof mixpanel !== 'undefined') mixpanel.track('LP Viewed', { page: 'evolution-of-staffing' });
    window.dataLayer = window.dataLayer || [];
    window.dataLayer.push({ event: 'lp_view', lp_name: 'evolution-of-staffing' });
  </script>

</BaseLayout>
